    {
      "sequence_id": 2,
      "text": "Today is your first day back after your trip to Southern Ita/y."
    },
    {
      "sequence_id": 3,
      "text": "As soon as you meet one of your acquaintances, you begin to ta/k about the p/aces and towns you've just visited."
